/**
 * Test script to enqueue FacturasIntegrationJob with comprehensive demo payload
 * matching the actual SAP B1 API response structure for Invoices.
 * 
 * This script will trigger the full asynchronous flow:
 * 1. Enqueue FacturasIntegrationJob (Queueable)
 * 2. Which then enqueues FacturasBatchJob (Batch)
 * 3. The batch job processes the mock payload and delegates to FacturasController
